# Bill of Materials (an extension): a STEP part linked twice and a
# second part once; Analyze > Bill of Materials lists them with their
# counts, files and groups, and writes them to a CSV file. The model is
# saved beside the parts' folder, so each file is named relative to it,
# as a link group's screen names it.
menu Assembly|Bill of Materials
tw
file $testdata/step/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/step/shapes/cylinder.step
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/step/shapes/cylinder.step
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/step/shapes/box.step
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
menu Assembly|Bill of Materials
tw
file $tmp/bom.csv
twmove 33 245
twdown L 33 245
twup L 33 245
tw
cat $tmp/bom.csv
